# Métodos do explorador de mercado (methodology/screens)

nucleo-metodo-erro-desconhecido = Unknown method: { $metodo }
nucleo-metodo-criterio-percentil = { $campo } at the { $pct }th percentile or above
nucleo-metodo-criterio-sem = No { $campo }
nucleo-metodo-campo-red_flags = score red flags
nucleo-metodo-higiene = Average daily liquidity of R$ { $liquidez } or more
nucleo-metodo-higiene-acoes-fiis = Average daily liquidity of R$ { $acoes } (stocks) and R$ { $fiis } (FIIs) or more
nucleo-metodo-higiene-nenhuma = No liquidity filter
nucleo-metodo-fora-classe = Class outside the method
nucleo-metodo-fora-setor = The method does not apply to the { $setor } sector
nucleo-metodo-fora-liquidez = Liquidity below R$ { $minimo } a day
nucleo-metodo-graham_defensivo = Defensive Graham
nucleo-metodo-graham_defensivo-ideia = Large, sound and cheap companies.
nucleo-metodo-graham_defensivo-fonte = Benjamin Graham, The Intelligent Investor, ch. 14
nucleo-metodo-graham_defensivo-nao-se-aplica = Banks, insurers and other financials (current ratio does not apply to them).
nucleo-metodo-graham_defensivo-ordem = By the margin to the Graham price, from highest to lowest.
nucleo-metodo-graham_defensivo-proventos-original = The book asks for dividends in each of the last 20 years; the B3 has too little history for that.
nucleo-metodo-bazin = Bazin
nucleo-metodo-bazin-ideia = High and steady dividends.
nucleo-metodo-bazin-fonte = Décio Bazin, Faça Fortuna com Ações
nucleo-metodo-bazin-nao-se-aplica = -
nucleo-metodo-bazin-ordem = By the margin to the Bazin ceiling price, from highest to lowest.
nucleo-metodo-bazin-sem_prejuizo-original = Bazin asks for profits in the last 5 years; here the stricter 10-year criterion applies, which is the one the app has ready.
nucleo-metodo-magic_formula = Magic Formula
nucleo-metodo-magic_formula-ideia = A good business at a low price.
nucleo-metodo-magic_formula-fonte = Joel Greenblatt, The Little Book That Beats the Market
nucleo-metodo-magic_formula-nao-se-aplica = Banks, insurers, holdings and power and sanitation utilities, as in the book.
nucleo-metodo-magic_formula-ordem = Ranks by EBIT/EV and by ROC, adds both positions and shows the lowest sum first.
nucleo-metodo-qualidade_preco_justo = Quality and price
nucleo-metodo-qualidade_preco_justo-ideia = High health by the Treasury score, sorted by price attractiveness.
nucleo-metodo-qualidade_preco_justo-fonte = Treasury health score (docs/asset-score.md)
nucleo-metodo-qualidade_preco_justo-nao-se-aplica = Classes without a score.
nucleo-metodo-qualidade_preco_justo-ordem = By the score attractiveness, from highest to lowest.
nucleo-metodo-fii_desconto = FIIs: income at a discount
nucleo-metodo-fii_desconto-ideia = FIIs below book value, with high income and a large holder base.
nucleo-metodo-fii_desconto-fonte = Usual FII analysis criteria (P/B, DY, liquidity, holders and vacancy)
nucleo-metodo-fii_desconto-nao-se-aplica = -
nucleo-metodo-fii_desconto-ordem = By DY, from highest to lowest.
nucleo-metodo-fii_desconto-dy-original = The reference is 80% of the CDI; here the floor is fixed at 8% a year until the method adjusts to the day's CDI.
